# 301s for the old Docusaurus site (deleted from the repository; its routes were /docs/<file>).
# Each old page goes to the page that now carries the same content; nothing goes to the home
# page, nothing chains into another rule. scripts/site/check-site-links.mjs verifies targets.
# More specific rules come first: Cloudflare Pages applies the first match.

